@startuml
title MEDORA -- Encounter Lifecycle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 192
skinparam backgroundColor #F5F9FE
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #183247
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #EAF3FB
  BorderColor #2563A6
  FontColor #183247
}
skinparam ArrowColor #2563A6
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #EAF3FB
  BorderColor #2563A6
  FontColor #183247
  FontSize 18
  ArrowColor #2563A6
}
[*] --> New : check-in accepted
New --> Waiting : queue assigned
Waiting --> InConsultation : clinician starts encounter [authorized]
InConsultation --> AwaitingService : required service order pending
AwaitingService --> InConsultation : required result reviewed
InConsultation --> AwaitingClosure : clinical plan complete
AwaitingClosure --> Completed : required summary signed [checklist satisfied]
AwaitingClosure --> InConsultation : missing requirement corrected
note right of Completed
  Completion is a controlled clinical transition, not deletion.
  Invoice settlement remains a separate financial lifecycle.
end note
Completed --> [*]
@enduml